PROVENANCE

Forked from https://github.com/qdrant/qdrant. Established from this
repository, not from documentation:

  - The history root of this branch is Qdrant's own first commit
    (e4452500a, 2020-05-30, Andrey Vasnetsov, "init"), and the full upstream
    history — 5421 commits — is present.
  - The last upstream commit carried here is a5a99b784 (2026-02-19,
    Tim Visée), immediately after 7ac17b142 "Bump version to 1.17.0". The
    fork base is therefore Qdrant 1.17.0, which lib/api/Cargo.toml still
    reports as its version.
  - The rebrand is d86e4dc55 (2026-03-03, "chore: rebrand to Hanzo Vector"),
    and only seven commits on this branch are Hanzo's.
  - 13 of the 14 crates under lib/ still declare their upstream authors,
    "Andrey Vasnetsov" and "Qdrant Team <info@qdrant.tech>", and all of them
    declare license = "Apache-2.0".

Attribution above uses the names the source itself carries. Qdrant's LICENSE
is the bare Apache-2.0 text with no copyright line (its appendix still reads
"Copyright [yyyy] [name of copyright owner]"), and no source file in the tree
carries a copyright header, so the manifests are the only in-repository
statement of authorship. The legal entity behind the project is not named
anywhere in this repository and is recorded here as UNVERIFIED: settling it
requires a statement from Qdrant, not an inference. An earlier draft of this
NOTICE said "Qdrant Solutions GmbH"; that string appears nowhere in Qdrant's
source or licence and was not carried forward.

Upstream Qdrant ships no NOTICE file — verified by searching the whole
history, where the only NOTICE blobs are the two Hanzo-authored ones. There
are therefore no Apache-2.0 §4(d) attributions to propagate, and this file
exists to identify the upstream, not to relay one.

LICENSE is Qdrant's, untouched since their own "Create LICENSE" commit
(76ea87a82, 2021-04-08). It is deliberately not edited: with no upstream
copyright line in it there is nothing there to preserve, and attribution
belongs in NOTICE.

DEVIATIONS

  - Rebranded to "Hanzo Vector"; the binary and root package are renamed from
    qdrant to hanzo-vector (d86e4dc55).
  - The root Cargo.toml's authors field was rewritten in that same commit from
    ["Andrey Vasnetsov", "Qdrant Team"] to ["Hanzo AI <eng@hanzo.ai>"]. That is
    the one place upstream authorship was removed; it is restored to the record
    here, and the 13 lib/ crates were never changed.
  - ZAP binary RPC transport added on port 6335, alongside upstream's REST
    (6333) and gRPC (6334) (fcc14c9ce).
  - Agent documentation added (LLM.md, with CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md as
    symlinks); docker-compose.yml renamed to compose.yml.
  - Config keys, storage layout and the REST/gRPC API surface are upstream's
    and are unchanged.

BRANCHES

The code lives on `master`. The repository's default branch, `main`, is an
unrelated five-file stub (README, LLM.md, CLAUDE.md, .github/hero.svg,
LICENSE) that shares no history with this branch and carries no source. Its
LICENSE declared MIT, which is corrected on that branch to match what this
product actually is.
